  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned} & {\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] A\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}-3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]} \\\\ & A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]^{-1}\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}-3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{array}\\right]^{-1} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\\)",
